      {
        "id": "tb-naming-syntax",
        "moduleId": "naming-constraint",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "命名约束的语法",
        "markdown": "命名完整性约束的基本格式为：\n\n```sql\nCONSTRAINT <完整性约束条件名> <完整性约束条件>\n```\n\n例如，为Student表的主码、性别检查和年龄检查命名：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE Student\n(  Sno CHAR(9),\n   Sname CHAR(20),\n   Ssex CHAR(2),\n   Sage SMALLINT,\n   Sdept CHAR(20),\n   CONSTRAINT C1 PRIMARY KEY (Sno),\n   CONSTRAINT C2 CHECK (Ssex IN ('男', '女')),\n   CONSTRAINT C3 CHECK (Sage >= 15 AND Sage <= 45)\n);\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000335"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "CONSTRAINT <完整性约束条件名> <完整性约束条件>"
              ],
