      {
        "id": "model-naming-benefit",
        "moduleId": "naming-constraint",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "约束命名的实际价值",
        "markdown": "在实际数据库运维中，命名约束的价值体现在：\n\n- **错误诊断**：当约束违反时，数据库返回的报错信息会包含约束名，便于快速定位问题。\n- **动态调整**：业务规则变化时，可通过`ALTER TABLE DROP CONSTRAINT`删除旧约束，再通过`ALTER TABLE ADD CONSTRAINT`添加新约束。\n- **文档化**：有意义的约束名（如`CHK_Student_Age`）本身就是对业务规则的自文档化说明。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-naming-intro",
            "tb-naming-syntax"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-modify-constraint",
        "moduleId": "modifying-constraint",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "修改表中的完整性限制",
        "markdown": "可以使用ALTER TABLE语句修改表中的完整性限制。例如：\n\n删除约束：\n```sql\nALTER TABLE Student\nDROP CONSTRAINT C3;\n```\n\n添加新约束：\n```sql\nALTER TABLE Student\nADD CONSTRAINT C3 CHECK (Sage >= 15 AND Sage <= 50);\n```\n\n修改年龄范围上限从45调整为50。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000337"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "修改表中的完整性限制"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6237,
