              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "d953b182a967e3c8bff5dab406c2d74be2920fc0e5255a0814ec4437fbec638d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-domain-constraint",
        "moduleId": "modifying-constraint",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "域中的完整性限制",
        "markdown": "SQL支持域（DOMAIN）概念，可以在域上定义完整性约束。创建域后可以将其作为属性的数据类型使用，从而实现约束的复用。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
